Conflict Resolution
When a name is taken, numeric suffixes are added:
add -> add       (first)
add -> add2      (conflict)
add -> add3      (conflict)
For explicit interface implementations, interface name is used:
clear -> clear             (own method)
clear -> clear_ICollection (explicit impl)
